==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} or {{etyl|ONF.|en}}; see {{m|fr|crochet}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{enPR|krō'kā}}, {{IPA|/ˈkrəʊkeɪ/|lang=en}} or {{IPA|/ˈkrəʊkɪ/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{enPR|krōkā'}}, {{IPA|/kroʊˈkeɪ/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{label|en|uncountable|games}} A [[game]] played on a [[lawn]], in which players use [[mallet]]s to drive [[ball]]s through [[hoop]]s ([[wicket]]s).
# {{label|en|countable|games}} A [[shot]] in this game in which the striker's ball and another ball are moved by hitting the striker's ball when they have been placed in contact following a roquet.
# {{label|en|countable}} A [[croquette]].

